  ],
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "A fighting-machine arrived, and fear drove us into the scullery.",
      "shot": 0,
      "at": 0.25,
      "seconds": 4.26
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "From that height, the Martian could see over our barrier.",
      "shot": 1,
      "at": 5.042,
      "seconds": 3.96
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "Through the hole, I watched Martians make metal in the pit.",
      "shot": 2,
      "at": 9.542,
      "seconds": 3.9
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "A tentacle placed a bright bar on the stack.",
      "shot": 3,
      "at": 13.958,
      "seconds": 3.09
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "We fought for the chance to look, kicking and thrusting near danger.",
      "shot": 4,
      "at": 17.583,
      "seconds": 4.09
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "Starvation waited, yet we fought over the peephole.",
      "shot": 5,
      "at": 22.208,
      "seconds": 3.87
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "He ate heavily and wept for hours, trusting his tears to save him.",
      "shot": 6,
      "at": 26.583,
      "seconds": 4.72
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "I counted every tin that still remained.",
      "shot": 7,
      "at": 31.833,
      "seconds": 3.32
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "His muttering drove me close to craziness; I could not think.",
      "shot": 8,
      "at": 35.75,
      "seconds": 4.78
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "He was weak, fearful, and false even to himself.",
      "shot": 9,
      "at": 41.042,
      "seconds": 4.48
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "At dusk, the whole pit glowed green with aluminium fire.",
      "shot": 10,
      "at": 46.042,
      "seconds": 5.08
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "The curate slid down; I took his place and watched.",
      "shot": 11,
      "at": 51.625,
      "seconds": 3.7
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "A tentacle reached into the cage and lifted a man against the stars.",
      "shot": 12,
      "at": 55.833,
      "seconds": 4.82
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "Then hooting began; I ran into darkness.",
      "shot": 13,
      "at": 61.167,
      "seconds": 3.61
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "curate",
      "text": "Do not leave me here! Come back, come back! I am alone in the dark with them near.",
      "shot": 14,
      "at": 65.292,
      "seconds": 6.5
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "Next day, I took hold of myself and weighed our chances.",
      "shot": 15,
      "at": 72.292,
      "seconds": 4.31
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "They might leave, or forget to guard the pit.",
      "shot": 16,
      "at": 77.125,
      "seconds": 3.51
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "Be quiet. One more sound, and I will strike you to keep us alive here in hiding together.",
      "shot": 17,
      "at": 81.167,
      "seconds": 5.36
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "The blow quieted him; I am ashamed, yet I would strike again.",
      "shot": 18,
      "at": 87.042,
      "seconds": 4.68
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "Those under such darkness may perhaps forgive me.",
      "shot": 19,
      "at": 92.25,
      "seconds": 3.7
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "Days later, I watched a lad die before me.",
      "shot": 20,
      "at": 96.458,
      "seconds": 3.96
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "I lifted the door and dug with my hatchet for hours.",
      "shot": 21,
      "at": 100.958,
      "seconds": 3.76
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "Two feet down, the earth collapsed with a crash and stopped me.",
      "shot": 22,
      "at": 105.25,
      "seconds": 4.0
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "I abandoned digging and lay on the flags.",
      "shot": 23,
      "at": 109.75,
      "seconds": 3.18
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "Then came a booming: great guns, far off, and men were still fighting.",
      "shot": 24,
      "at": 115.458,
      "seconds": 5.48
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "Six reports, then six more in reply.",
      "shot": 25,
      "at": 122.458,
      "seconds": 4.14
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "curate",
      "text": "Guns. Those were guns. Someone still fights them out there.",
      "shot": 26,
      "at": 128.125,
      "seconds": 5.5
    }
  ],
  "plan": "ff4ebdb8288da032"
}